# A tab inside a project's name shows as a space in the paths that name it: a view entry's path and the breadcrumbs.
file <<END
Big	Work:
	- Ship @due({today+2})
END
keys gU j
see - Ship  Big Work
hide BigWork
keys gz
see › Big Work
hide BigWork
quit
saved <<END
Big	Work:
	- Ship @due({today+2})
END
